&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Tasteful, furnished penthouse apartment with 4 rooms and a balcony\n\nThis apartment is a totally renovated house, finished in December 2022. This is a very special apartment in Forstwald, Krefeld. On a total of 130 square meters, you live in a luxurious and fully furnished apartment, right on the outskirts of Dusseldorf.\n\nThe apartment is located on the first and second floor and is divided into a large living - and dining area, two bedrooms, a separate kitchen, and a large south facing terrace.\n\nAlready when entering the apartment the large & bright entrance area impresses. A separate room as walk-in cabinet offers enough space to store your clothes.\n\nAt the end of the hallway you enter into the spacious living - and dining area, which is also very bright due to its floor-to-ceiling windows and doors. There, among other things, you find a cozy living landscape with home theater, and - on the opposite side - a large dining table, which offers enough space for at least six people.\n\nIf you open the door from the living room, you get to the terrace. Here you have enough space to barbecue with friends in the summer or simply enjoy the evening after work.\n\nThe large bedroom offers quiet nights and a beautiful view into the garden as well as a high-quality box spring bed. Other bedroom is at your disposal,  if you are currently working in home office - you also have an extra writing desk in this bedroom at your disposition.\n\nThe apartment is equipped with a large wellness bathroom. The entire flat has a high value parket flooring with an underfloor heating system.\n\nThe location is an ideal starting point to get to Dusseldorf. Located in a quiet area you find both green surroundings but also supermarkets, restaurants and other shops in walking distance. Here you can move in, unpack your suitcase and feel right at home!","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"5"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"heating":{"value":"electrical"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"yes"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"120"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":230000,"deposit":250000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"2300.00","deposit":"2500.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":1,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-03-30"}],"updated":"2026-03-30T10:24:13Z","__utId__":"ut1257713"}]